"A file of module parameters whose mark is the symbol `qualified`, its
 spelling before keywords (C557; Fixpt's 23af3a07): refused, as Fixpt
 refuses it, `#:qualified` its spelling now."
(define m-base (load-module "loads/mark-base.fx"))
(define m-q ((load-module "loads/mark-old-qualified.fx") m-base))
(define main (subr pure () string) (lambda () (i64->string ((with m-q four)))))
